# Locale alias map. Format: <input>:<output>, one per line, '#' starts a
# comment. Surfer reads this in scripts/build-release.sh's package step
# (via @bento-browser/surfer's getLocales) to translate short locale
# codes from `supported-languages` into Mozilla's full BCP-47 locale tags.
#
# Bento ships en-US only for M1, so this file is currently empty of
# actual mappings — the en-US line in supported-languages doesn't need
# remapping. Add entries when shipping additional locales:
#   nb:nb-NO
#   pt:pt-BR
#   zh:zh-CN
